<QF id="PMS Derivatives_7" sectionNumber="" articleNumber="0" articleName="">
    <question>
        <text><![CDATA[At-the-money (ATM) option has:]]></text>
        <answers>
            <answer correct="yes"><text><![CDATA[Strike = spot]]></text></answer>
            <answer correct="no"><text><![CDATA[Strike >> spot]]></text></answer>
            <answer correct="no"><text><![CDATA[Zero delta]]></text></answer>
            <answer correct="no"><text><![CDATA[Infinite gamma]]></text></answer>
        </answers>
        <explanation><text><![CDATA[**The Logic:** ATM = strike ~ spot; delta ~ 0.5.
**The Trap:** Other statements misstate ATM behaviour.
**Cross-Exam Context:** Same in VIII.
**Distributor's Pro-Tip:** ATM options are often used in delta-neutral strategies and volatility plays.]]></text></explanation>
    </question>
</QF>
